Code vendored

tools/bench/vendor/ponytail/SKILL.md is copied verbatim from ponytail, which is MIT
licensed:

    https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail

    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2026 DietrichGebert

The full licence text is beside it at tools/bench/vendor/ponytail/LICENSE, and the
file is not edited. It is there only so that one arm of `pnpm bench:tokens` measures
the real ruleset rather than a paraphrase of it. Nothing in TinyCorp reads it, and
the rigor of ponytail's own benchmarks — isolate the arms, publish the limitations,
withdraw a number that turns out to have been contaminated — is what docs/bench-tokens.md
is modelled on.

