Logos vendored

The logos TinyCorp draws beside somebody else's product — a coding CLI an Employee
runs on, a service an MCP preset connects to — are individual SVG files copied
unmodified from two icon sets. Neither set is a dependency of this app: only the
files that are really drawn are in the repo, in src/renderer/src/ui/logos/, with
both licence texts beside them.

